   $q$What is the main purpose of sentence 9 in the writer's argument?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It repeats the erosion results from sentence 5 so that readers remember them.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-repetition"},{"text":"It shows that Okafor believes seawalls should never be built anywhere along the coast.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It explains why the reefs' yearly growth makes them a stronger choice than a seawall over time.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It adds a new statistic about how many fish live among the oyster reefs.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-purpose"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It explains why the reefs' yearly growth makes them a stronger choice than a seawall over time.$q$, $q$Sentence 8 reports that the reefs grow taller each year, and sentence 9 explains what that means: the barrier repairs itself while a wall weakens. The fish count is in sentence 8, not sentence 9, so sentence 9 adds analysis rather than a new statistic.$q$, 'draft', 'aa188600-a618-5070-b6ce-b986ea6b4591')
