   $q$Which sentence should be deleted because it does not support the analysis of the story?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Sentence 4, because describing Mr. Abara takes attention away from Teodor.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"Sentence 3, because the quotation is too short to be useful.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-key-evidence"},{"text":"Sentence 9, because a general fact about pianos says nothing about how Teodor changes.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Sentence 8, because it does not include a quotation from the story.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"removes-analysis"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Sentence 9, because a general fact about pianos says nothing about how Teodor changes.$q$, $q$Sentence 9 is a general fact about piano care, not evidence from the story. Sentence 4 matters because Mr. Abara's slow, careful method is the model that Teodor later follows.$q$, 'draft', 'ed20a3a4-dd83-52e9-ae1c-07011d2f86b0')
