   $q$Which phrase best fills the blank at the start of sentence 5?$q$, $q$[{"text":"For this reason","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"},{"text":"To sum up","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"premature-conclusion"},{"text":"In contrast","is_correct":true},{"text":"Similarly","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"false-similarity"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$In contrast$q$, $q$Sentence 4 describes the street before the market and sentence 5 describes a very different situation afterward, so "In contrast" fits. Shops closing at six did not cause later hours, so "For this reason" sets up the wrong link.$q$, 'draft', 'c1b0f55b-26fe-5cb1-a767-e8fc11297af6')
